  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: configuration-file injection in the configparser module\n     when writing multi-line values that contain carriage returns\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-0864.patch: normalize CRLF and bare CR to LF\n       before applying the newline-to-tab continuation escape in\n       _write_section() in Lib/configparser.py, so an attacker-controlled\n       value can no longer inject additional keys and sections into the\n       written file; adds the upstream regression test\n       test_crlf_normalization to Lib/test/test_configparser.py.\n     - CVE-2026-0864",
